      "notes": "IDE-132 – Paysafe Payfac model (Ready For UAT/Production)\n\nThis is another implementation of Paysafe where we will act as a Payfac under Paysafe. Basically it means we will have to create just one account for Paysecure under Paysafe and for each individual merchants' of ours we will create a sub-account under it.\nAdditionally in the API calls we need to pass some additional parameters to paysafe regarding the merchants.\nAPI flow remains the same.\n\nAccount ID: \n1002757450 - Card EUR - Assigned MID\n1002768430 - Card EUR - Shared MID\n \n \n\n1002997100 - Paysecure GBP (GBP)\n1002997110 - Paysecure EUR (EUR)\n1002997120 - Paysecure USD (USD)\n\nLinked issues:\n• IDE-1940 – NA is showing in cardholder field.  (Done)\n• IDE-1948 – Paysafe Payfac: Partial refund is not working properly.  (Done)\n\nAttachments in Jira:\n• paysafe_payfac_qa_checklist.docx (14 KB)\n• Paysafe PayFac Solution for Platforms and Payment Facilitators.pptx (26361 KB)\n• Screen Recording 2026-09-16 121312.mp4 (127592 KB)",
